WEBVTT

00:00.460 --> 00:03.100
Never forget your poker face.

00:03.100 --> 00:07.550
With his father's teachings in his heart, the miraculous magician glides through skyscrapers.

00:07.550 --> 00:09.830
Enter Kaitō Kid!

00:09.830 --> 00:13.030
Today's target is the Crystal Mother.

00:13.030 --> 00:15.860
Now, it's show time!

00:15.860 --> 00:20.860
kimi no namida ni kon’na ni koishite’ru

00:15.860 --> 00:20.860
I love your tears so much

00:20.860 --> 00:23.410
Whoa, this summer day, summer night

00:23.410 --> 00:27.040
soba de waratteitai yo

00:23.410 --> 00:27.040
I want to laugh by your side

00:34.590 --> 00:39.050
bōhatei atsui sunahama

00:34.590 --> 00:39.050
On a pier on a warm sandy beach

00:39.050 --> 00:44.300
machiwabita kiseki yatto otozureta

00:39.050 --> 00:44.300
The miracle I longed for finally came true

00:45.510 --> 00:49.640
dōka kono mama stay with me

00:45.510 --> 00:49.640
Please, stay with me, just like this

00:49.640 --> 00:53.100
Everything for you, I’ll always think of you

00:55.730 --> 00:59.740
hoshi furu yoru wa koishikute

00:55.730 --> 00:59.740
I miss the nights with shooting stars

00:59.740 --> 01:04.370
negai komete koe no kagiri utau no

00:59.740 --> 01:04.370
I wish and sing with all of my voice

01:05.660 --> 01:10.080
mō tomerarenai my sweet song

01:05.660 --> 01:10.080
I can’t stop my sweet song anymore

01:10.080 --> 01:15.580
nakisō na koe de I love you

01:10.080 --> 01:15.580
In a tearful voice I cry ‘I love you’

01:15.580 --> 01:20.050
koe ni naranai hodo hito o suki ni nari

01:15.580 --> 01:20.050
When you like someone so much that you can’t verbalise it

01:20.050 --> 01:22.630
Whoa, this summer day, summer night

01:22.630 --> 01:25.340
nanimo kamo ga takaramono

01:22.630 --> 01:25.340
Everything’s a treasure

01:25.340 --> 01:25.850
Baby...

01:25.850 --> 01:30.380
kimi no egao ga kon’na ni yūki kureru

01:25.850 --> 01:30.380
Your smile gives me so much courage

01:30.380 --> 01:35.690
hakanaku itoshii kono kimochi dakishimete

01:30.380 --> 01:35.690
as I embrace this fleeting love

01:35.690 --> 01:42.820
kimi no yokogao zutto zutto mitsumete’ta

01:35.690 --> 01:42.820
I’ve always, always been watching you from your side.

01:56.940 --> 01:58.610
Yo! I'm Kaito Kuroba.

01:58.610 --> 02:02.660
My dad, Tōichi Kuroba, a world-famous magician,

02:02.660 --> 02:06.160
the greatest thief of the century, and the true identity behind Kaitō Kid,

02:06.160 --> 02:09.750
was murdered in what seemed to be a magic show gone wrong eight years ago.

02:09.750 --> 02:13.960
In order to unveil the organisation who killed my dad, I became the second Kid

02:13.960 --> 02:17.210
to steal the Big Jewels they're looking for one after another!

02:17.920 --> 02:22.300
Of course, my childhood friend
and classmate, Aoko Nakamori,

02:22.300 --> 02:26.510
and her father, Inspector Nakamori of the Tōkyō Police, have no idea that I'm Kid.

02:27.260 --> 02:31.480
But it seems some guys <i>did</i> figure out my identity.

02:31.480 --> 02:34.440
The mysterious assassin sent by the organisation, Spider.

02:34.440 --> 02:38.150
To cover himself, his day job is being the world's greatest illusionist.

02:38.150 --> 02:40.940
Just what is he plotting?!

02:41.700 --> 02:47.160
Well, maybe magnificent gentleman thieves are just fated to be followed by trouble.

02:47.910 --> 02:50.330
And tonight's treasure is…

02:53.880 --> 03:01.380
The Tearful Crystal Mother

03:12.550 --> 03:14.560
Pleased to make your aquaintance, Your Majesty.

03:14.560 --> 03:18.140
Is this magnificent Japanese train to your liking?

03:18.980 --> 03:21.020
Yes, very much so.

03:34.160 --> 03:37.660
Did you watch the sunset from the peace of your room?

03:37.660 --> 03:39.040
Yes, thanks to you.

03:39.040 --> 03:41.710
This lounge car was reserved specially for you.

03:41.710 --> 03:47.170
Though really, it would've been better to have all the cars on the train reserved…

03:47.170 --> 03:52.930
No. It was I who wished to have contact with
Japanese citizens, even if it is but a few of them.

03:52.930 --> 03:55.930
You <i>did</i> ask for that, but…

03:55.930 --> 04:00.600
And thanks to that, I was able
to meet a famous personage too.

04:00.600 --> 04:04.860
Oh? I looked over the passenger list, but I didn't…

04:05.820 --> 04:07.570
It was Kaitō Kid.

04:07.570 --> 04:08.280
What?!

04:09.190 --> 04:10.280
Stand down.

04:10.280 --> 04:14.620
You must not be so rude to someone
from the Japanese police.

04:14.620 --> 04:16.540
Y-You really met Kid?

04:16.540 --> 04:19.710
I saw him in my private room earlier.

04:19.710 --> 04:27.250
As he announced, he came to steal this, my country's
treasure, the largest topaz in Europe, the Crystal Mother.

04:27.250 --> 04:30.300
Then why didn't he take it off you?

04:31.300 --> 04:34.800
I'm sure that he realised it the moment he laid eyes on it…

04:34.800 --> 04:35.970
It's a fake.

04:35.970 --> 04:37.680
A fake?!

04:37.680 --> 04:40.810
Yes. The real gem is hidden in a certain place.

04:40.810 --> 04:41.940
'A certain place'?

04:41.940 --> 04:45.230
Why, I'm afraid I cannot reveal that,
Inspector. Not even to you.

04:45.230 --> 04:48.820
As Kid may be listening somewhere on this train.

04:48.820 --> 04:51.950
All right! Kid's already on the train!

04:51.950 --> 04:54.280
Check each and every passenger!

04:54.280 --> 04:55.160
Yes, sir!

04:55.160 --> 04:59.790
Please stop. Do not trouble yourselves for the sake of the Principality of Ingram.

04:59.790 --> 05:01.000
But Your Majesty…

05:01.000 --> 05:05.580
This is a battle between Kid and I. A one-on-one fight lasting the two and a half hours until we reach the final station,

05:05.580 --> 05:08.090
shall decide whether he will steal the jewel as he announced,

05:08.090 --> 05:12.090
or whether I will protect the honour of my country.

05:12.090 --> 05:13.590
Hey, Mother…

05:13.590 --> 05:15.760
Isn't your necklace a little off?

05:15.760 --> 05:18.010
Philip, what are you doing?

05:18.010 --> 05:21.140
I told you earlier not to leave your room.

05:21.140 --> 05:23.520
And how many times have I told you?

05:23.520 --> 05:26.230
When around others, address me as 'Your Majesty'.

05:26.230 --> 05:27.110
But…

05:27.110 --> 05:28.690
Your Highness!

05:31.820 --> 05:34.070
Your Highness, I've been looking for you.

05:34.070 --> 05:37.820
Alice, aren't you being too kind to him?

05:37.820 --> 05:39.370
You should know better than to—

05:39.370 --> 05:40.950
I sincerely apologise.

05:40.950 --> 05:42.290
It's not Alice's fault.

05:43.250 --> 05:45.580
Excuse me, but who's…

05:47.080 --> 05:50.210
This is Alice, who is tasked with looking after Prince Philip.

05:50.210 --> 05:57.930
Since my husband, King Henry, died two years ago,
she is the only person I trust from my heart.

05:57.930 --> 05:59.930
Now, come this way…

05:59.930 --> 06:02.890
The fake's a different shape from when I saw it before!

06:10.320 --> 06:12.190
This is a bug!

06:12.190 --> 06:14.650
Then when he crept into her room, he must've…!

06:16.660 --> 06:18.570
You listening, Kaitō Kid?!

06:18.570 --> 06:22.950
You won't lay a finger on the jewel as long as I'm here!

06:26.830 --> 06:28.630
That clumsy inspector…!

06:28.630 --> 06:31.420
What's wrong, Kaito? Your face's all weird.

06:32.170 --> 06:34.380
I-It's nothing.

06:34.380 --> 06:36.260
I just got yelled at by your dad.

06:39.390 --> 06:41.390
What're you annoyed about?

06:41.390 --> 06:44.560
You're the one who wanted
to ride a luxury train, right?

06:44.560 --> 06:47.520
That's why I begged my dad and he finally let—

06:47.520 --> 06:52.320
Hey, hey, I'm always thankful for your father.

06:52.320 --> 06:53.690
What's with you? Geez!

06:53.690 --> 06:57.280
We're about to meet Her Majesty after all.

06:57.280 --> 06:59.780
Ah! It's almost time for dinner!

07:04.790 --> 07:08.370
The ordinary passengers are riding in the observation car.

07:08.370 --> 07:12.000
The car immediately behind us is the dining car.

07:12.000 --> 07:14.960
The Queen'll likely be coming there too.

07:14.960 --> 07:18.880
Then everything from the lounge car to her private room is reserved…

07:18.880 --> 07:24.060
But the guys from the Organisation have gotta be lurking somewhere to get the jewel too.

07:24.060 --> 07:26.480
So I'll get my chance when it's dinner time, huh?

07:26.480 --> 07:30.730
I've gotta figure out where the real jewel is before they do.

07:30.730 --> 07:34.190
Hmm? Kaito, why're you spacing out?

07:34.190 --> 07:36.940
Get it together! We're going to greet Her Majesty!

07:36.940 --> 07:37.940
G-Greet her?

07:37.940 --> 07:38.860
Yeah!

07:38.860 --> 07:44.870
As the daughter of Inspector Nakamori who's always punishing Kid, that is!

07:44.870 --> 07:46.790
Huh… You serious?

07:49.040 --> 07:51.250
I know that too.

07:51.250 --> 07:56.880
If Kid showed up in the Queen's room,
then it can't have been hidden there.

07:56.880 --> 08:01.970
The queen must be hiding the real jewel on her, or else the Prince is.

08:03.140 --> 08:04.640
Good luck on your search.

08:04.640 --> 08:06.430
Hey, Spider!

08:06.430 --> 08:10.230
Where are you hiding? Don't cause me any trouble!

08:10.230 --> 08:12.060
Who's causing trouble?

08:15.610 --> 08:16.400
Damn it.

08:18.240 --> 08:21.990
It would've been better to have dinner in the lounge car…

08:21.990 --> 08:26.040
If you are that worried, then
stay by my side and protect me.

08:26.040 --> 08:29.000
The Inspector shall be having dinner with me.

08:31.370 --> 08:33.290
B-But…

08:33.290 --> 08:35.880
Do not be so nervous.

08:35.880 --> 08:38.760
That's an idea, how would you like an apéritif?

08:38.760 --> 08:40.130
I shall prepare one.

08:40.130 --> 08:41.880
Huh? A-Alcohol?!

08:41.880 --> 08:43.800
Ah, no, I'm on duty, so I…

08:43.800 --> 08:48.520
Why, you are the first one to ever refuse one of my drinks.

08:48.520 --> 08:52.310
W-Well, if you insist, maybe just one glass…

09:06.120 --> 09:12.080
Having a drink made by a queen is the highest honour!

09:12.080 --> 09:13.580
Huh? Dad…

09:13.580 --> 09:15.290
Woah, he's drinking…

09:15.290 --> 09:17.250
Oh, so you're here!

09:17.250 --> 09:20.920
Majesty! This is my daughter Aoko,
and her friend, Kaito-<i>kun</i>.

09:22.510 --> 09:26.300
P-Pleased to meet you, Your Majesty!

09:30.180 --> 09:33.060
Where? Where's the real jewel?

09:33.060 --> 09:35.980
In her hat? Her bag?

09:35.980 --> 09:38.980
Or maybe the cat?

09:38.980 --> 09:41.860
Perhaps in that cat's eyes…!

09:43.320 --> 09:44.530
Over here, Caesar!

09:45.950 --> 09:47.120
Here!

09:48.580 --> 09:49.830
Hey…

09:49.830 --> 09:51.700
Her Majesty's cat came to him?

09:51.700 --> 09:52.790
You can't be…

09:52.790 --> 09:56.210
I'm Philip Maximilian d'Ingram.

09:56.210 --> 09:58.670
The Prince?!

09:58.670 --> 10:02.840
Yeah. Here! You were looking at this cat, weren't you?

10:02.840 --> 10:03.470
Yeah.

10:03.470 --> 10:07.220
Ah, he's so cute. Lemme hold him!

10:08.800 --> 10:12.220
Man, you're hopeless, Aoko…

10:12.220 --> 10:13.640
It's my chance!

10:13.640 --> 10:16.560
Let's see, the right eye's normal. The left ey—

10:19.650 --> 10:22.070
Damn it. It's just a normal cat.

10:22.070 --> 10:23.900
You okay, Kaito?

10:23.900 --> 10:25.150
Yeah.

10:28.700 --> 10:30.700
That's a cute bear you're holding.

10:30.700 --> 10:34.540
Ah, this was a present from my father.

10:34.540 --> 10:37.920
That so? Ah! Its eyeball's coming off!

10:38.420 --> 10:39.790
Let me see.

10:40.710 --> 10:41.550
Let's see—

10:43.970 --> 10:45.260
Alice!

10:45.260 --> 10:48.220
Your Highness, let's go back to your room.

10:48.220 --> 10:48.970
But…

10:51.180 --> 10:54.100
You're Kaitō Kid, right?

10:55.230 --> 10:58.600
S-Stop joking around, Your Highness.

10:58.600 --> 11:00.520
Oh, so I was wrong?

11:00.520 --> 11:03.230
And I know where the jewel's hidden and everything.

11:04.240 --> 11:06.150
But I won't tell you.

11:06.150 --> 11:07.780
You brat…

11:07.780 --> 11:11.700
Now, let's go, Your Highness.
Her Majesty is not amused.

11:17.500 --> 11:20.170
No, Alice! I'm staying here!

11:20.170 --> 11:23.250
I'll protect my mother and the jewel from Kid!

11:23.840 --> 11:25.840
How thoughtful for your mother.

11:25.840 --> 11:28.180
I hate my mother.

11:28.180 --> 11:32.100
Mother changed since Father died.

11:33.720 --> 11:37.560
She used to be so kind, but now she's just angry!

11:37.560 --> 11:41.150
I'm sure she hates me.

11:41.150 --> 11:47.530
But I promised Father that I'd protect Mother for him…

11:52.620 --> 11:54.950
So… So…

12:11.340 --> 12:15.180
She used to be so kind, but now she's just angry!

12:15.180 --> 12:18.770
I'm sure she hates me.

12:18.770 --> 12:25.150
But I promised Father that I'd protect Mother for him…

12:26.230 --> 12:28.570
So… So…

12:30.190 --> 12:32.610
I'll stay here!

12:40.450 --> 12:42.540
Please, wait…

12:43.370 --> 12:48.380
A child like you wouldn't
understand even if I told you!

12:48.380 --> 12:49.590
Mother!

12:49.590 --> 12:52.880
Not 'Mother', 'Your Majesty'!

12:52.880 --> 12:55.800
You must be more aware of your place.

12:55.800 --> 12:57.890
Y-Your Majesty, isn't that a bit too far…?

12:58.560 --> 13:00.720
I will not allow you in here again!

13:01.930 --> 13:02.930
Mother!

13:02.930 --> 13:04.850
Do you understand?

13:06.400 --> 13:08.770
Leave me be.

13:12.780 --> 13:18.490
What's with your face, Aoko?
Don't worry! He's a man.

13:21.620 --> 13:25.460
Mother… Mother!

13:33.720 --> 13:35.430
Was that right?

13:35.430 --> 13:36.590
Yes.

13:36.590 --> 13:40.430
Unless I go that far, he will never understand.

13:40.430 --> 13:42.640
And he has Alice, after all.

13:43.100 --> 13:47.810
I am certain she understands my feelings.

13:47.810 --> 13:51.570
Now, go ahead, Inspector.
Please, have some more to drink.

13:59.490 --> 14:01.620
Yummy!

14:06.920 --> 14:10.670
Hey, Kaito. If you're not
gonna eat that, can I have it?

14:10.670 --> 14:12.550
Eh, sure.

14:12.550 --> 14:14.010
Yay!

14:14.010 --> 14:17.550
Dinner's ending… Where's the jewel?!

14:22.180 --> 14:25.060
Your Majesty, you can tell me now…

14:25.060 --> 14:26.770
Where's the jewel hidden?

14:26.770 --> 14:31.560
Just a bit longer. I shall tell you
once we reach the final stop.

14:31.560 --> 14:35.240
Although I am certain it shall surprise you.

14:36.690 --> 14:40.620
Where is it? If I don't hurry…

14:41.570 --> 14:46.540
Ah, kitty! Good boy, good boy!

14:46.540 --> 14:47.750
Come here...

14:48.960 --> 14:54.380
Huh? That's odd. It didn't change at all.

14:54.380 --> 14:56.800
Normally, the size would've…

14:56.800 --> 15:00.050
I've figured out where the jewel is!

15:03.140 --> 15:05.560
Wait, kitty…

15:06.020 --> 15:07.730
It's now or never…

15:09.480 --> 15:12.730
Huh? Kitty…

15:13.900 --> 15:16.320
Ah, there you are!

15:23.120 --> 15:25.910
Umm… Excuse me?

15:25.910 --> 15:27.660
Are you okay?

15:42.140 --> 15:45.140
Twenty minutes to the final stop…

15:47.060 --> 15:50.560
It appears that I have succeeded after all.

15:54.150 --> 15:57.940
A blackout?! You've finally turned up, Kid!

15:59.360 --> 16:00.530
Your Majesty!

16:02.490 --> 16:07.200
D-D-Don't misunderstand!
I was just trying to protect Her Majesty…

16:07.200 --> 16:10.580
Never mind that, where's your glass, Inspector?!

16:10.580 --> 16:12.040
Glass?

16:12.040 --> 16:13.170
It's over…

16:13.170 --> 16:13.960
What?!

16:21.420 --> 16:24.140
Which one is your glass?

16:24.140 --> 16:26.760
Ah, well, how should I…?

16:27.140 --> 16:28.430
Find it, quickly!

16:36.440 --> 16:38.860
So that's it…

16:38.860 --> 16:42.360
The jewel was in my glass with the ice…

16:42.360 --> 16:44.320
What a bold move for her.

16:50.160 --> 16:51.250
Here it is!

16:51.250 --> 16:54.040
The Crystal Mother is safe!

17:00.010 --> 17:02.130
K-Kaitō Kid!

17:07.140 --> 17:11.350
I'm honoured to see you again, Your Majesty.

17:11.350 --> 17:14.810
How foolish… There is nowhere you can escape.

17:16.150 --> 17:18.900
Remember this, Your Majesty.

17:18.900 --> 17:21.360
Kaitō Kid is an elusive phantom…

17:21.360 --> 17:25.820
…who always finds out where jewels are hidden.

17:25.820 --> 17:32.950
And I also know that though you are a <i>queen</i>,
you have the <i>heart</i> of a mother!

17:35.420 --> 17:36.420
W-Wait!

17:37.000 --> 17:38.840
Wait, Kid!

17:38.840 --> 17:39.750
Damn it!

17:41.090 --> 17:43.720
As naïve as always, Inspector.

17:43.720 --> 17:46.930
You always get tricked by my dummies.

17:46.930 --> 17:53.270
Quickly! Phone ahead and block off the whole area! Don't let him get away!

17:53.270 --> 17:54.430
Yes, sir!

17:55.190 --> 17:55.980
Dad!

17:57.440 --> 17:59.810
Come over here, Dad! It's terrible!

17:59.810 --> 18:01.190
Aoko?

18:05.490 --> 18:06.530
Give it back!

18:06.530 --> 18:09.410
That belongs to the people of my country!

18:09.410 --> 18:10.200
Give it back!

18:12.950 --> 18:15.500
You did well, getting here alone.

18:16.210 --> 18:17.420
I'm not alone.

18:19.830 --> 18:25.550
I said Kid would be here, so Alice helped me.

18:27.550 --> 18:28.340
Alice?

18:28.340 --> 18:30.600
No! That's not Alice!

18:39.980 --> 18:42.400
Spider, leave that kid alone!

18:42.400 --> 18:44.530
You came here to kill <i>me</i>, right?!

18:45.320 --> 18:48.070
Seems that you've been looking forward to my show.

18:53.370 --> 18:56.160
Thanks for the help, Spider. Now stand aside.

18:56.160 --> 18:58.120
Kid, hand over the jewel!

19:00.540 --> 19:02.840
It seems trouble has arrived.

19:04.460 --> 19:07.260
But I've prepared your nightmare!

19:07.260 --> 19:08.220
What?!

19:08.220 --> 19:10.640
Let's put a smile on that face.

19:17.810 --> 19:18.890
Kid…

19:19.350 --> 19:21.100
Don't move, Kid!

19:21.100 --> 19:22.560
Put the jewel down there!

19:22.560 --> 19:26.030
Hmph. I just held it up to the moon.

19:26.030 --> 19:29.900
It's not the Pandora that you're searching for.

19:31.870 --> 19:34.280
Silence! I'll check that for myself!

19:34.280 --> 19:35.870
Turn around!

19:35.870 --> 19:41.620
Hmph. There wasn't even any point in hiring that suspicious assassin.

19:41.620 --> 19:43.630
I've done the job myself.

19:43.630 --> 19:46.550
Well, I wonder about that.

19:51.630 --> 19:52.890
Don't underestimate me!

20:08.230 --> 20:10.650
So, are you okay?

20:11.360 --> 20:12.990
Give the jewel back!

20:12.990 --> 20:16.950
What's this? Is that any way to talk to
someone who just saved your life?

20:17.410 --> 20:21.370
If we don't have it, my country's
people will be in trouble.

20:21.830 --> 20:24.920
I'm not gonna give it to a liar.

20:26.090 --> 20:31.010
You really want your mother to
praise you for getting it back, right?

20:33.050 --> 20:34.050
Ain't that right?

20:35.430 --> 20:39.390
If you want to find out your mother's
feelings, I know a good way!

20:42.730 --> 20:46.650
It seems she was attacked by
someone right after boarding.

20:46.650 --> 20:48.610
That Kid…

20:48.610 --> 20:50.860
He disguised himself as her.

20:50.860 --> 20:53.820
Alice… What a disaster.

20:53.820 --> 20:56.530
You were attacked, I lost the jewel…

20:56.530 --> 20:58.450
Your Majesty…

20:58.450 --> 21:01.410
It is all my responsibility.

21:01.410 --> 21:05.380
As Queen, I failed to protect my country's honour.

21:07.040 --> 21:08.500
Where's Philip?!

21:08.500 --> 21:10.050
Mother…

21:13.760 --> 21:15.220
Prince Philip…

21:15.220 --> 21:17.640
Philip, you…?

21:19.600 --> 21:21.600
I'm sorry, Mother.

21:21.600 --> 21:26.690
I chased Kaitō Kid up to the roof
to try and get the jewel back…

21:28.230 --> 21:30.400
But he took it.

21:36.490 --> 21:38.910
M-Mother…

21:43.370 --> 21:46.290
Why did you not listen to me?

21:46.290 --> 21:49.250
Why do you <i>always</i> put yourself in danger?!

21:49.250 --> 21:53.920
Why have I steeled my heart so,
and been so harsh on you…

21:53.920 --> 21:58.180
If I cannot even protect you in your father's place…

21:59.600 --> 22:02.470
But I'm glad…

22:04.270 --> 22:07.350
I'm glad you're safe… I really am.

22:08.310 --> 22:10.270
Mother!

22:11.230 --> 22:13.190
Your Highness…

22:15.610 --> 22:21.540
I'm happy for ya, Prince. Your
mother really <i>is</i> the Queen of Hearts.

22:21.540 --> 22:25.710
Come on, men shouldn't cry.

22:25.710 --> 22:27.460
And didn't I tell you?

22:27.460 --> 22:30.420
Call me 'Your Majesty'.

22:33.050 --> 22:34.920
Isn't this great?

22:38.720 --> 22:45.430
T-T-This is…!

22:51.180 --> 22:56.730
kimi ni zenzen kyōmi nai uso you are my perfect guy

22:51.180 --> 22:56.730
I’m not interested in you at all — I’m lying, you are my perfect guy

22:56.730 --> 23:01.480
tokimeki wa kakusenai honto wa ki ni natte shikatanai

22:56.730 --> 23:01.480
I can’t hide my beating heart, I’m really into you, I can’t help it

23:01.480 --> 23:06.450
koi ni bukiyō son'na style kimi no mae da to betsujin mitai

23:01.480 --> 23:06.450
I’m no good at love, with a bad style, I become someone else when facing you

23:06.450 --> 23:11.540
dare ni mo ienai himitsu no mama

23:06.450 --> 23:11.540
I don’t tell anyone about it

23:11.540 --> 23:16.210
soredemo I'm all right koi no yukue nante

23:11.540 --> 23:16.210
Still, I’m all right, love just isn’t for me

23:16.210 --> 23:20.790
mada it isn't the last chance for me

23:16.210 --> 23:20.790
and it still isn’t the last chance for me

23:20.790 --> 23:25.970
iron'na love story o egaite'ru mune no naka

23:20.790 --> 23:25.970
I have many love stories carved into my heart

23:25.970 --> 23:31.640
demo risō ni wa hodo tōi

23:25.970 --> 23:31.640
but they’re far from my ideals

23:31.640 --> 23:36.640
watashi-tte wagamama sore kurai no koto wakatte'ru

23:31.640 --> 23:36.640
I know I’m selfish but…

23:36.640 --> 23:43.360
dakedo nanika ikenai no?

23:36.640 --> 23:43.360
…is there anything wrong with that?

23:43.360 --> 23:48.530
kimi to no koi ni koi o shite'ru dake de

23:43.360 --> 23:48.530
Just being in love with you is enough

23:48.530 --> 23:53.490
tsutaetakutemo mada

23:48.530 --> 23:53.490
I couldn’t confess even if I wanted to…

23:53.490 --> 23:58.580
himitsu ni shite'ru hō ga shiawase dakara

23:53.490 --> 23:58.580
I’m happier with it being a secret

23:58.580 --> 24:06.300
ima wa watashi dake no secret love

23:58.580 --> 24:06.300
so for now, it’ll be my secret love

24:07.130 --> 24:09.220
The demonic mask, Nightmare.

24:09.220 --> 24:13.810
A mysterious planner who teams up with thieves all over the world to set up perfect crimes.

24:13.810 --> 24:17.270
And Kaitō Kid gets a heartfelt request from such a suspicious guy?!

24:17.270 --> 24:21.310
Next time: 'Tears of Love for the Dark Knight'.

24:18.690 --> 24:21.310
Tears of Love for the Dark Knight

24:21.310 --> 24:26.280
Next Kid's Magic: Riot Police Member!

24:26.280 --> 24:28.320
Ah, Kid got away, I'm in tears again!

24:28.320 --> 24:30.620
On top of your tears, Merry Christmas!
